      "content": "communication doesnt really help when the person you're talking to isnt even \"there\" anymore. i can feel it happening. every day i feel less like myself and more like a stranger in my own skin. i just keep thinking about how much i hate the idea of being a burden, just sitting there staring at a wall while everyone watches me fade away. it feels so much more dignified to just... stop before the end comes for me.",
